    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a state though. it feels more like a fact. like the real me just died when he left and what's left is just... a shell. i go through the motions, i eat, i sleep, but there's nobody home. it just feels pointless to keep pretending there's someone inside here.",
